{
  "jcr:primaryType": "datareq:Catalogue",
  "title": "Demo clinical registry",
  "description": "An invented registry, so that choosing data from one can be shown without a real dictionary. Two versions, because what a submitter chose from is the point: v2 is what is published now, and v1 is what somebody who filed earlier is still answering against.",
